OL,3,GNEWSASeal population 'may be reaching  
OL,4,Anatural plateau'                       
OL,6,FThe grey seal population at one of the 
OL,7,Flargest colonies in England may have   
OL,8,Freached a natural plateau, a wildlife  
OL,9,Franger said.                           
OL,11,FIt comes as the National Trust, which  
OL,12,Fmanages the Farne Islands off the      
OL,13,FNorthumberland coast, begins the annual
OL,14,Fcensus to monitor the mammals' numbers 
OL,15,Fand health.                            
OL,17,FIn the 2025 breeding season, 3,385 grey
OL,18,Fseal pups were recorded on the islands,
OL,19,Fa 6.6% reduction from 2024.            
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
