OL,3,GNEWSASeal population 'may be reaching  
OL,4,Anatural plateau'                       
OL,6,FArea ranger Tom Hendry said: "Today's  
OL,7,Ffigures suggest the population may be  
OL,8,Freaching a natural plateau, reflecting 
OL,9,Fthe amount of suitable habitat         
OL,10,Favailable for seals to pup across the  
OL,11,FFarne Islands."                        
